--
--Method: .origDbArrGet()
--
-- Description: method to return the array of project origDbs being used by
-- the DB Definition form.
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- method Type:   method/Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
-- Return:
--   [Data Type] [Description]
--    ARRAY       Array of project origDb DBREF's
